msgid "Looks like you guys are having fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Yeah! We're teaching Akira-kun how to bat, since he's never\r\n"
"played baseball before. It's not going so good, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I know, Uncle Kaz! You hit some balls and we'll try to catch\r\n"
"them! Sounds fun, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Heh, yeah I don't mind taking a few swings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Awesome! C'mon, Akira-kun! Let's go catch some fly balls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

